cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MotifSTaR, please cite this software and the associated paper when available."
title: "MotifSTaR: allele-level reconstruction and analysis of short tandem repeat motif composition"
type: software
version: 1.4.7
date-released: 2026-09-21
authors:
  - family-names: Rahaman
    given-names: Md Mamunur
  - family-names: O'Shaughnessy
    given-names: Daniel
  - family-names: Zussa
    given-names: Zoe
  - family-names: Smith
    given-names: Andrew
  - family-names: Henden
    given-names: Lyndal
  - family-names: Berkovsky
    given-names: Shlomo
  - family-names: Williams
    given-names: Kelly L.
repository-code: "https://github.com/Mamunur-20/MotifSTaR"
abstract: >-
  MotifSTaR reconstructs strand-normalized, allele-level short tandem repeat
  motif structures from ExpansionHunter REViewer SVG files using
  catalogue-aware repeat selection, full-spanning reads, genotype-aware
  consensus, and explicit quality-control rules.
keywords:
  - short tandem repeat
  - repeat expansion
  - motif interruption
  - ExpansionHunter
  - REViewer
  - bioinformatics
